  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy work to support private sector engagement for delivering Ukraine Recovery Conference policy objectives e.g. delivering Business Fair/Sectoral roundtables at the URC; development of Ukraine Business Compact and research to develop a War Risk Insurance Framework; and post-URC follow-up.</narrative>
